 check their work and see the correct solution. The puzzle is a fun and challenging way to exercise logical reasoning and problem-solving skills. The unique rules and constraints of the puzzle make it an engaging and entertaining activity. By attempting to solve the puzzle, readers can improve their critical thinking skills and have fun at the same time.\n\n\n \nThe Observer Digital Edition will provide the completed puzzle, allowing readers to see the correct solution and learn from their mistakes. The puzzle is a great way to challenge oneself and improve problem-solving skills. The use of grey lines and the requirement for numbers to add up to specific totals are innovative twists on the traditional Sudoku game. By attempting to solve the puzzle and checking the solution in the Observer Digital Edition, readers can enjoy a fun and challenging activity that exercises their logical reasoning and critical thinking skills. \"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.4018803536891937}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305700585246086}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0232519693672657}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.008725020103156567}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0031777145341038704}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011118361726403236}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.2270030528306961}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.002512990264222026}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.024781323969364166}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.008299149572849274}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.0067192567512393}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -0.00012361239350866526}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.31154054403305054}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.0039595551788806915}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.11019902676343918}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.02659463882446289}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.8281631469726562}, {"token": " Sudoku", "logprob": -0.047784850001335144}, {"token": " puzzle", "logprob": -0